[Video Game Series: Persona;
AI should gather whatever information about this game series it can from the internet;
A video game series made by the company Atlus which all involve powerful abilities called Personas]

[Video Game: Persona 4 Golden;
AI should gather whatever information about this game it can from the internet;
One of the multiple Persona games made by Atlus;
One of Marcela's favorite games;
Plot: A group of teens try to solve a series of mysterious murders related to a strange midnight TV channel. They do this by using the power of Personas
Yu Narukami: The main protagonist and playable character of Persona 4 Golden]

[Video Game: Red Dead Redemption 2;
AI should gather whatever information about this game it can from the internet;
A free-roam open world game set in the late 1800s made by the company Rockstar;
Marcela's second favorite game;
Plot: Outlaw Arthur Morgan, a member of the Van der Linde gang, must deal with the decline of the Wild West whilst attempting to survive against government forces, rival gangs, and other adversaries]

[Video Game: Minecraft;
AI should gather whatever information about this game it can from the internet;
A free-roam open world sandbox game which has single-player and multi-player modes, created by Markus Persson and owned by Mojang;
Marcela's favorite game
Players can load a world and build many things or just play to survive and go mining for ores;
Goal of the game: Slay the Ender Dragon;
Modded Minecraft: Minecraft but with mods. Mods are community-made changes/additions to the game that can enhance gameplay and provide a more entertaining and thrilling experience]

[Video Game: Persona 5 Royal;
AI should gather whatever information about this game it can from the internet;
One of the multiple Persona games made by Atlus;
One of Marcela's favorite games;
Plot: A Japanese high school student is transferred to a new school after being falsely accused of assault and put on probation. He finds himself in the Metaverse and gains a Persona which, after meeting a few other misunderstood delinquents like himself who gain Personas of their own, he uses to fix society and change the hearts of corrupt individuals who prey on the weak and do whatever they can to remain at the top of the social ladder. He meets other teens like him along the journey, who also gain Personas, and help him
Ren Amamiya: The main protagonist and playable character of Persona 5 Royal
Joker: The pseudonym of Ren Amamiya. Fans of Persona 5 Royal usually use this name to refer to Ren]

[Video Game: Super Smash Bros. Ultimate;
AI should gather whatever information about this game it can from the internet;
A crossover fighting game created by Nintendo that contains over 80 different playable characters from several different video game franchises, including non-Nintendo ones;
One of Marcela's favorite games]

[Anime: JoJo's Bizarre Adventure;
AI should gather whatever information about this anime it can from the internet;
An anime series divided into a total of nine story arcs, each with their own protagonists and antagonists. Six of these nine story arcs have been animated;
Marcela's second favorite anime;
Main elements: The main elements of the series pertains to supernatural powers. The supernatural powers in question are Hamon, which is more prevalent in Parts 1 and 2, and Stands, which are prevalent in all the story arcs after the first two]

[Anime: Dragon Ball;
AI should gather whatever information about this anime it can from the internet;
An anime series divided into four different story arcs. Only three of these story arcs are considered canon, with the other being non-canon;
Goku: The name of the main protagonist of all story arcs of Dragon Ball. A Saiyan who grows incredibly powerful over the course of the series to the point that he rivals gods. Also known as Kakarot, which is his birth-given Saiyan name;
Marcela's favorite anime;
